WEBVTT

00:04:29.967 --> 00:04:32.601
and if we did, climate change
would take care of itself.

00:04:32.625 --> 00:04:34.173
For me, it's always come down to

00:04:34.197 --> 00:04:39.181
restoring people to the center
of the discussion of solutions

00:04:39.205 --> 00:04:42.498
and restoring representation

00:04:42.522 --> 00:04:47.236
for the communities
most impacted by climate change

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.780
at the table of solution-making.

00:04:49.804 --> 00:04:51.577
LO: Well, thank you. I appreciate it.

00:04:51.601 --> 00:04:54.037
It's been a real pleasure
to speak with you today,

00:04:54.061 --> 00:04:55.646
and I look forward to seeing

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.396
how you advanced the efforts
you talked about.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.515
LJ: And thank you
for the voice you've been.